      "path": "rules.0;rules.1;gaps",
      "issue": "정확히3회 조건·max300전 대상 적용·nested maxHealth식 단위 관계 누락 및 Armor4초 누락",
      "correction": "매3번째 조건, jungle전용상한,100bonusAD당3.5%식, 공통%단위 및KO Armor4초를 정정했다.",
      "sourceId": "en:body",
      "quote": "Passive: Every 3rd Attack on the same target deals an additional (4/5/6/7/8% + (3.5% per 100 bonus Attack Damage)) max Health physical damage, removes 20% Armor and grants Vi 30/35/40/45/50% Attack Speed for 4 seconds. It also reduces the remaining Cooldown of Blast Shield by 4 seconds. Deals a maximum of 300 damage against jungle monsters."
    },
